{"id":46076,"vol":{"id":5755,"name":"Nightwing"},"num":"36","name":"Nothing But Time - Escape to Blackgate, Part Two","title":"Nightwing #36","year":"1999","date":"1999-10-01","store":"1999-08-11","poster":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_medium/0/4/40834-5755-46076-1-nightwing.jpg","big":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_large/0/4/40834-5755-46076-1-nightwing.jpg","pub":"DC Comics","deck":"","desc":"Trapped in the bowels of Blackgate, Nightwing must convince the other inmates to aid him in his escape. And, if he succeeds, he has to figure out what to do after he's released dozens of Gotham City's most insane and deadly costumed villains. \"Escape to Blackgate\" part 2.\n\nNightwing woke up \"in the hole\" after being knocked out by Lock-Up. He was able to win over enough inmates to save himself. Lock-Up and his supporters feared intervention by Batman.","people":[{"id":41486,"name":"Chuck Dixon","role":"writer"},{"id":43255,"name":"Darren Vincenzo","role":"editor"},{"id":1806,"name":"Jamison","role":"colorist"},{"id":9421,"name":"John Costanza","role":"letterer"},{"id":51970,"name":"Joseph Illidge","role":"editor"},{"id":1516,"name":"Karl Story","role":"inker, cover"},{"id":44255,"name":"Roberta Tewes","role":"colorist"},{"id":2218,"name":"Scott McDaniel","role":"penciler, cover"}],"chars":[{"id":1691,"name":"Dick Grayson","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/12/124259/9337371-nightwing-113-open-to-order-artist-spotlight-variant-lee.jpg"},{"id":3726,"name":"Scarecrow","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/12/124259/8135266-tumblr_b0e9b5e9433fcf268cc0a1ef6986e299_a07c97e4_1280.png"},{"id":5814,"name":"Mad Hatter","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/0/229/88074-157108-mad-hatter.jpg"}],"arcs":[{"id":42106,"name":"\"Batman\" No Man's Land"}]}